  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x9D3C" flags="0x0">
    <title>Stationary Limiter Readiness Threshold</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x8FDC; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. Calibrated inclusive readiness threshold for stationary rev-limiter accumulator ffff16a6. FUN 0004f324 sets readiness bit 4 of ffff247f when the accumulator is greater than or equal to this scalar and its secondary gate passes. The stock value is 381 accumulator counts. The threshold controls readiness for stationary fuel-cut/restore hysteresis 000085d9/000085da. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000911c through JK08A-1ME3B.definition-addresses.csv: normalized-shape pair 00076b90/0007b25e reads the 0x04b0 readiness threshold at the same call ordinal.</description>
