  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x29C3" flags="0x0">
    <title>Fuel Compensation - Main - Default</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0xA0F4; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. Fuel Compensation Map: the unsigned output is a multiplicative fuel correction with raw 128 = 100% as neutral. The result participates in calculating fuel-delivery duration and undergoes uint16 saturation. Target variant: Default. The machine trace establishes the multiplicative role, while A2L and homolog EV18A 0xa2f6 establish the physical name and scale with the shared layout offset of +0x5c. This is neither a lambda target nor an AFR reciprocal. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000a29a through JK08A-1ME3B.definition-addresses.csv: both target compensation accessors 0003357c and 000486e0 read the exact surface on the first selector arm and 0000a1f4 on the second with the exact axes 00013d06 and 00013d26 through the 16x16 uint8 leaf 000298b4 as 1ND0A 00030810 and 00044f1c read 0000a1c0 and 0000a2c0 through 000285f4.</description>
